module examples.err_layout_unaligned_offset

# plans/M7.md item B, 03-hardware.md §2: "The compiler and target ABI check
# width, alignment, non-overlap, bounds, and endianness." A 32-bit register
# at an offset four does not divide is not a register the machine can
# access as one, whatever the author wrote.

@layout(mmio, endian=little)
struct VirtioIrqMmio:
    @offset(0x062) interrupt_status: ReadOnly[u32]
